==Event Information==
Unbelievable! Stupendous! Incredible!<br>
The Battle Cats has reached {{Color|#FF00FF|'''27 Million Downloads Worldwide!'''}} Thanks sooooooo much!<br>
Let's kick off the 27 Million Celebration Campaign: {{Color|#FF00FF|'''March 1st (11:00am) through March 14th, 2017 (11:00am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Limited Edition Celebration Stages!'''}}<br>
Devilishly difficult special stages appear again!<br>
Take on {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival'''}} and {{Color|#FF0000|'''Deadly Carnival II'''}} when you log in to Battle Cats and visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages!<br>
Clearing Stage 1 gets you 3 Normal Tickets! Stage 2 gets you a RARE TICKET!<br>
Don't wait, the time to test your skills is now!<br>
<small><small>※Update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats to access these stages.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Monthly All-Star Stages!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''Insane-difficulty Monthly All-Star Stages'''}} bring back all of the toughest bosses from the limited-edition Monthly Stages! Now with 3☆ Difficulty!

{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Special Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''March 1 (11am) thru March 3 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Ultra Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''March 3 (11am) thru March 6 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Miracle Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''March 6 (11am) thru March 9 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Wonderful Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''March 9 (11am) thru March 12 (11am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Excellent Celebration'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''March 12 (11am) thru March 14 (11am)'''}}

Clear these stages for a chance to collect tons of XP!<br>
<small><small>※Update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats to access these stages.<br>
※2☆ Stages must first be cleared to access 3☆ Stages.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Half-Off Energy Costs for Empire of Cats or Into the Future on select days!'''}}<br>
During this celebration, enjoy {{Color|#FF00FF|'''half-off energy costs'''}} for {{Color|#008000|'''Empire of Cats on even dates'''}}, and for {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Into the Future on odd dates!'''}}<br>
Clear the Story Mode chapters with speed and ease!<br>
<small><small>※Empire of Cats Ch. 1 must be cleared to receive this half-off energy benefit.<br>
※Update to the most recent version of The Battle Cats to access these stages.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Special adventure areas for your GAMATOTO Expedition!'''}}<br>
Send your brave Gamatoto explorers to hunt for treasures at {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest (Easy, Normal, Hard)'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}}!<br>
Get even bigger item and XP rewards, check 'em out today!<br>
Don't miss out!

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Catamin/Catfruit Limited Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
On the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between normal Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catamin/Catfruit Limited Capsules'''}}!<br>
Speed up your Gamatoto! Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!<br>
<small><small>※The Catamin Limited Capsules will provide Catamin and XP!<br>
※The Catamin Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 1 Greece is completed. Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this Celebration Campaign, every day you log into the Battle Cats app will reward you with a {{Color|#008000|'''20 Cat Food'''}} present!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

